# 设计

## 概述
对应需求：FR-1, FR-2, FR-3, FR-4. The existingvaluebool is copied perstruct andraced; pointersharedstate remedies both. This is an inputDATA scope independent of frozenoutputDATA.

## 技术方案
transfer.go gains inputConsumptionState containing mutex,consumed andoriginalbinding/hash/length/context anchors. detachedTransfer retains its existingfields for originaltest compatibility and gains onlystatepointer. receiveTransfer creates the state once after existingboundedstream/hash/EOF validation. take denies nilstate, locks sharedstate, checks originalanchors plus currentmetadata, then sets sharedconsumed at the originalsuccessfulhandoff boundary before cloning. Originalwrongbinding failures remain nonconsuming; originaltests are not rewritten. A valuecopy cannot provide changedbinding,payload orcancelcontext to revive/redirect an anchoredowner.

Nativeowners/leases/handleclose andoutputpublication remain untouched. No lifecycle capability is minted by sharedpointer identity.

